description:
Added support for parsing option 162 Discovery of Network DNS resolvers in DHCPv4 (RFC 9463).

[dhcpv4_dnr_packets.pcapng](/uploads/2c35246f2d09349cdcd9abb440c77bf3/dhcpv4_dnr_packets.pcapng)

Simple option, two instances:

![image.png](/uploads/41c215653dae1d4e92852e1a178ec254/image.png){width=339 height=298}

ADN-only mode:

![image.png](/uploads/ee372f5e7e5262feda1994d1610c2914/image.png){width=444 height=375}

Malformed option (addr_len not a multiple of 4):

![image.png](/uploads/01263c974496f84961abf8f98d9b0c15/image.png){width=464 height=243}

notes.body:
Ok, I changed it so that Addresses is a FT_NONE item with a subtree with the individual Address items below it, like this:

![image.png](/uploads/10f91b8e503d83711edaaae7ba4e0449/image.png){width="432" height="337"}

Is that what you were suggesting?

